@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v2
@token = replace-with-local-token
@semester = replace-with-semester-uuid
@stateVersion = 1
@budgetVersion = 1

### Enable STUDYFLOW_READINESS_ENABLED=true and start readiness_worker first.
GET {{base}}/readiness/templates/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### A planning declaration is not a bank receipt. Explicitly confirm the reserve.
POST {{base}}/readiness/semesters/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: semester-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"room":"shared","opening_balance":"140000.00","as_of":"2026-08-01","reserve":"15000.00"}

### Refresh all three version fields before every new write.
GET {{base}}/readiness/state/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

### Incomplete template returns known subtotals and issues, never "funds sufficient".
POST {{base}}/readiness/budgets/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: budget-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"semester_id":"{{semester}}","state_version":{{stateVersion}},"budget_version":{{budgetVersion}}}

### Forecast includes estimates but excludes unconfirmed income by default.
POST {{base}}/readiness/forecasts/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: forecast-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"semester_id":"{{semester}}","state_version":{{stateVersion}},"budget_version":{{budgetVersion}},"horizon":90,"conditional":false}

### Deterministic nonloan-first recommendation; does not submit a loan.
POST {{base}}/readiness/funding-plans/recommend/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: recommendation-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"semester_id":"{{semester}}","state_version":{{stateVersion}},"budget_version":{{budgetVersion}},"actions":[]}

### Queue real/mock AI according to the worker's explicit configuration.
POST {{base}}/readiness/checks/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: check-example-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"semester_id":"{{semester}}","state_version":{{stateVersion}},"budget_version":{{budgetVersion}}}

### Risk cards and deduplicated notifications.
GET {{base}}/readiness/risks/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/readiness/notifications/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
